Package: spark-wasm-server
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Lantern <team@getlantern.org>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6
Conflicts: spark
Description: Exit-side server for spark's dynamic WASM transports
 spark-wasm-server terminates the tunnels a spark client opens through a
 delivered WebAssembly transport module. It verifies the signed bundle against
 a key compiled into the binary, runs the module as responder, and relays to
 the address the client announced. For BIP324 it is the splitting egress: a
 listener indistinguishable from a Bitcoin node, which fronts a real one.
 .
 This is a server package. It shares no files with the spark client package and
 is not useful on a client host.
